                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Sure recommended for the fans of the Planet Ancyra quadrologie, even if you can get it for free, when having Solarix, what will give you access to Planet Ancyra Chronicles, where both games (Solarix and De-Void) are combined. For Solarix, it changes from an active stealth game to a walking sim, adding De-Void at the end, what keeps the same content. De-Void is a short walking sim, lasts up to three hours, for sure the most challenging part, so as gaining all achievments, is the desert run, where you must follow an unguided rotation through wrecked parts, so as collecting audio logs and interacting with corpses. A good guide can be found here: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cQiiwGJYIFU \nFor players, who are not interested in this series, but want to have some action- simply get Reframed, this is the most offensive part. Solarix is the same, but more on the needed stealth tactics, this in order to survive. Planet Ancyra Chronicles, for seeing all again but without enemies, and finally De-Void, ending all this on the official way.\nHere for the overview:\nSolarix \t2015\nDe-Void \t2016\nPlanet Ancyra Chronicles \t2017\nReFramed \t2018  \nYou want some space, some unnatural stuff, some fighting and stealth, some difficulty, some walking in endless areas, seeing gigantic equipment, exploring for many hours, this series is the right choice.",
